description:
Transport UK East Midlands Limited (EMR) is running this procurement for the provision of BulkFuel Supplies to three depot locations referred to below and in accordance with the Procurement Act 2023 using the Competitive Flexible Procedure.
a) Etches Park Depot, Derby;
b) Eastcroft Depot, Nottingham;
c) Cricklewood Depot, Cricklewood.
The combined estimated annual volume of product is 47,706,000 litres - Gas Oil to BS EN590 Gas OilA2 (Red Diesel).
